flowchart TB
    Browser[Shopify Admin browser]
    Shopify[Shopify GraphQL Admin / Partner APIs]
    Postmark[Postmark]
    Obs[Logs, metrics, Sentry]

    subgraph Runtime[Application runtime]
        Web[Embedded web service\nReact Router / Node.js]
        Worker[Background worker\nNode.js]
        DB[(PostgreSQL\nPrisma + pg-boss)]
    end

    Browser -->|Verified session token| Web
    Shopify -->|HMAC webhooks and callbacks| Web
    Postmark -->|Authenticated provider webhooks| Web
    Web -->|Tenant-scoped transactions + jobs| DB
    Worker -->|Lease jobs + tenant-scoped state| DB
    Worker -->|Cost-budgeted GraphQL; expiring offline token| Shopify
    Worker -->|Validated at-most-once sends| Postmark
    Web -->|Redacted telemetry| Obs
    Worker -->|Redacted telemetry| Obs
